<title>ITALY: Rome airports Jan air cargo/mail traffic down 11.3.</title>
<headline>Rome airports Jan air cargo/mail traffic down 11.3.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rome airport operator Aeroporti di Roma said total cargo and mail traffic at the Italian capital's two airports, Fiumicino Leonardo de Vinci and Ciampino, fell 11.3 percent to 20,606 tonnes compared to the same period 1996.</p>
<p>Cargo passing through the airports included</p>
<p> Jan 1997	  Cargo    Pct change	Mail    Pct Change</p>
<p> Fiumicino	16,274    down  16.2	3,570   up   11.9</p>
<p> Ciampino	    759    up    22.2	    3    n.a.</p>
<p> Total	    17,033    down  15.0	3,573   up   12.0</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
